      "statement": "celld is an open-source daemon that runs Cloudflare Workers and Durable Objects on self-hosted machines, storing long-term state in a bucket the operator owns (S3-compatible, Google Cloud Storage, or Azure Blob Storage), with no serving control plane and no consensus service.",
