      "id": "claim_8e08f5d45d7d4943abbac320597a4277",
      "statement": "A cell maps to a Cloudflare Durable Object: a small server with a name and a private SQLite database that serves HTTP, holds WebSockets, sets alarms, and runs one cell on one thread with synchronous storage ops. Cell states are resident (active or idle), hibernated (retains hibernatable WebSocket clients on its node), and inactive (an object in the bucket, the state every cell starts in).",
